                    <button type="button" class="os-cta" onclick="goToCheckout()">Continue to Checkout</button>
                    <p class="os-reassure"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#6b7280;"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M12 8v13"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 8c-1.5-3.5-6-3.5-6-1s4 2.5 6 1c2 1.5 6 1.5 6-1s-4.5-2.5-6 1Z"/></svg> Gift note included &mdash; write your message at checkout</p>
                </div>
                
                
            </div>
